OL,3,ANetanyahu defends Israeli military
OL,4,Aaction as delegates walk out before UN
OL,5,Aspeech
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsraeli Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,8,FNetanyahu has fiercely defended his
OL,9,Fcountry's military campaigns in Iran,
OL,10,FGaza and elsewhere in the Middle East
OL,11,Fin a speech to the UN General Assembly.
OL,13,FAfter dozens of delegates walked out in
OL,14,Fprotest as he took to the stage,
OL,15,FNetanyahu vowed to continue fighting:
OL,16,F"We're going to win. We have no other
OL,17,Fchoice."
OL,19,FIn response to the walkout, he said:
OL,20,F"If there are any other moral cowards
OL,21,Fwho haven't left the hall, please do so
OL,22,Fnow."
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
